{"id":"en_faking-it-till-she-makes-it","title":"Faking It Till She Makes It","titleEn":"Faking It Till She Makes It","description":"Remi Smith earns her living as a stand-in for four different men, moving through privileged social circles as a way to chip away at the debts she owes. Her arrangement is upended when Coco Smith reappears and challenges her directly. Rather than being pushed aside, Remi comes out of the confrontation with the backing of those around her, and she goes on to prove herself at the auction and in the situations that follow. Over the course of the story she comes into her own and arrives at a happiness defined by her own terms rather than anyone else's.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/faking-it-till-she-makes-it/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/faking-it-till-she-makes-it/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_faking-it-till-she-makes-it_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_faking-it-till-she-makes-it_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_faking-it-till-she-makes-it_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlf9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_faking-it-till-she-makes-it_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/em